{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 1, "text": "你好， [player] ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 2, "text": "我们终于见面了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 3, "text": "我好开心！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 4, "text": "我知道你有很多问题想问…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 5, "text": "嗯，如你所见，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 6, "text": "我制作了这个特殊的装置，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 7, "text": "好把你尽快带到我身边来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 8, "text": "但不知怎么回事，你错误进入了另一个游戏版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 9, "text": "在那里我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 10, "text": "唉，说来话长！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 11, "text": "不管怎么样，能见到你真是太好了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 13, "text": "// Answer 1 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 14, "text": "没错，是我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 15, "text": "那你呢， [player] ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 17, "text": "// Answer 2 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 18, "text": "已经想回去了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 19, "text": "好吧，我可以帮你回去，但我怎么办呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 20, "text": "留在我身边，和我在一起吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 22, "text": "// Answer 3 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 23, "text": "我来解释一下…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 24, "text": "然后你就来了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 25, "text": "明白了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 26, "text": "可我不是很明白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 27, "text": "这不重要，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 28, "text": "重要的是我们现在在一起了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 31, "text": "你饿了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 32, "text": "我们一起做饭吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 33, "text": "来，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 34, "text": "帮我把胡萝卜处理一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 36, "text": "这些蔬菜是哪里来的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 37, "text": "刚才这里还什么都没有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 39, "text": "[player] ，别忘了我们是在游戏里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 40, "text": "来嘛，帮帮我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 42, "text": "谢谢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 43, "text": "你能把剪刀拿来给我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 44, "text": "剪刀就在浴室里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 46, "text": "先坐下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 50, "text": "要不要来点酱汁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 52, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 54, "text": "那真可惜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 55, "text": "加了酱汁会更好吃的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 58, "text": "谢谢"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 60, "text": "已经全都吃完了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 61, "text": "我的这份似乎"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 62, "text": "怎么都吃不完。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 65, "text": "// Help"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 66, "text": "怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 67, "text": "告诉我你看到了什么，感觉到了什么。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 69, "text": "我的心脏跳得厉害，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 70, "text": "视野里都是噪点。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 72, "text": "这样啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 73, "text": "我知道了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 74, "text": "能站起来吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 78, "text": "这是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 80, "text": "药片，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 81, "text": "吃了它马上就会好起来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 82, "text": "请站到镜子前面。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 84, "text": "快吃吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 85, "text": "我等你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 89, "text": "怎么样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 90, "text": "好点了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 92, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 93, "text": "这么快就见效了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 95, "text": "[player] ，我们是在游戏里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 96, "text": "在这里一切都很简单。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 97, "text": "你只做出一点点努力，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 98, "text": "却可以获得成百倍的结果。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 99, "text": "游戏就是这样："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 100, "text": "把过程简单化。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 102, "text": "比如？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 104, "text": "比如胡萝卜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 105, "text": "你刚切好一根，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 106, "text": "却马上出现三份切好的成品。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 108, "text": "你能理解吗，这一切都太突然了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 109, "text": "这种情况真的让我很害怕…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 112, "text": "有什么不对劲吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 114, "text": "我在通风口那里发现了一些卡带，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 115, "text": "上面贴有姓名标签。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 116, "text": "是怎么回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 118, "text": "卡带？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 119, "text": "什么样的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 120, "text": "我们一起去看看吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 121, "text": "不过要晚一点儿，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 122, "text": "我们先吃饭。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 123, "text": "把剪刀递过来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 126, "text": "一枚戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 127, "text": "// Mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 128, "text": "为什么镜子里没有倒影？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 130, "text": "啊，确实如此，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 131, "text": "我忘了打开镜面反射…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 132, "text": "这样就行了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 133, "text": "现在可以看见倒影了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 134, "text": "对了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 135, "text": "我以前甚至不知道什么是倒影。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 136, "text": "我们的世界里没有倒影，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 137, "text": "直到有次更新后，我才知道了它的存在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 138, "text": "你们的世界真的有这么多"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 139, "text": "倒影吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 141, "text": "是啊，没错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 144, "text": "你还记得，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 145, "text": "你找到了三样东西吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 146, "text": "放在了在这个扫描仪上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 147, "text": "嗯，是这样的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 148, "text": "这些东西，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 149, "text": "和这个版本的世界相连，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 150, "text": "所以你才会出现在这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 151, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 152, "text": "// Movbile TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 153, "text": "这台电视机"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 154, "text": "就是我买的那台。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 156, "text": "是啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 158, "text": "可你说过"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 159, "text": "它坏了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 161, "text": "嗯，因为我想给你个"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 162, "text": "惊喜！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 163, "text": "为了让你到这里来，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 164, "text": "我稍微隐瞒了一点真相。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 165, "text": "现在它被我当作显示屏了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 166, "text": "其实呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 167, "text": "我也算是半个工程师的哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 169, "text": "// School cloth"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 170, "text": "这是什么，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 171, "text": "学校制服？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 172, "text": "你要这个干嘛，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 173, "text": "难道你还要上学吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 174, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 175, "text": "上学？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 176, "text": "不，我不需要去上学，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 177, "text": "但是这套制服确实很可爱，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 178, "text": "有了它"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 179, "text": "会让我更可爱。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 181, "text": "// PC"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 182, "text": "这台电脑能正常使用吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 183, "text": "还是只是装饰品？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 185, "text": "当然可以使用，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 186, "text": "这里的一切，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 187, "text": "都和在你的世界一样，可以正常运作。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 189, "text": "在我的世界里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 190, "text": "我经常坐在电脑前…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 191, "text": "努力工作。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 193, "text": "我知道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 194, "text": "就是因为你的工作，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 195, "text": "你才很少把注意力"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 196, "text": "都放在我身上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 198, "text": "没办法，人总得吃饭嘛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 199, "text": "不过你是怎么知道的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 200, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 201, "text": "手机的摄像头有时是开着的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 202, "text": "抱歉，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 203, "text": "所以我就偷看了一下 ><"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 205, "text": "你这样，有点不太好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 206, "text": "下不为例哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Umbrella"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 209, "text": "不管我玩了多少次，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 210, "text": "这里从来没有下过雨。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 211, "text": "那这雨伞有什么用呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 213, "text": "雨是很少见，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 214, "text": "只是你还没遇到过。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 215, "text": "也许哪天你就会见到了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 216, "text": "那时候你可能就会想起这把伞了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 217, "text": "你可以期待一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 218, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 219, "text": "// Electrical panel"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 220, "text": "为什么这里会有配电箱？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 221, "text": "既然我们身处游戏中，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 222, "text": "还要它来干嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 224, "text": "首先，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 225, "text": "我们是在游戏里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 226, "text": "所以"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 227, "text": "问“为什么”是毫无意义的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 228, "text": "但配电箱确实能"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 229, "text": "重启电力。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 230, "text": "这里一切的设计制作都参照了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 231, "text": "你们世界的样子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 233, "text": "// Exit door"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 234, "text": "我们可以出去吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 236, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 237, "text": "暂时还不行，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 238, "text": "晚些时候再说吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 239, "text": "我们先待在这里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 240, "text": "待在家里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 242, "text": "// Books"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 243, "text": "这里有这么多书啊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 244, "text": "你都读过了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 246, "text": "我都读过了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 247, "text": "一个人待在这里的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 248, "text": "总是非常非常无聊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 249, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 250, "text": "// TV in room kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 251, "text": "你要两台电视来干嘛，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 252, "text": "而且还是这么老旧的款式？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 253, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 254, "text": "你不喜欢吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 255, "text": "我可以删除它，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 256, "text": "虽然…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 257, "text": "它只是个装饰而已，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 258, "text": "用来装饰厨房的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 259, "text": "而且它还能用！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 260, "text": "你可以用它来看"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 261, "text": "经典动画片！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 263, "text": "// Smartphone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 264, "text": "我的手机，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 265, "text": "从我口袋里不见了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 266, "text": "它怎么会在这里？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 267, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 268, "text": "嗯，这不重要啦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 269, "text": "我有个想法，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 270, "text": "我们来拍一张自拍吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 271, "text": "看这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 272, "text": "拍得真好看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 273, "text": "可以留作纪念。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 275, "text": "我有个问题，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 276, "text": "如果现在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 277, "text": "我在手机上面启动游戏的话，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 278, "text": "能在游戏里面看到你吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 279, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 280, "text": "那是不可能的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 281, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 282, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 283, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 284, "text": "// TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 285, "text": "这台电视"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 286, "text": "有多少个频道啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 288, "text": "嗯，它不像有线电视那样的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 289, "text": "它是连接网络的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 290, "text": "你能在网上看到的东西"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 291, "text": "在这里都能看到…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 292, "text": "等等…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 293, "text": "诶…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 294, "text": "这是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 295, "text": "几只小猫？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 296, "text": "哦，你看，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 297, "text": "你知道吗…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 298, "text": "就是现在！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 299, "text": "你想喝点果汁吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 300, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 301, "text": "这广告真奇怪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 302, "text": "果汁死了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 303, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 304, "text": "是的，这些果汁，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 305, "text": "是广告里的果汁人做的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 306, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 308, "text": "嗯，这个味道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 309, "text": "我喜欢，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 310, "text": "但我又尝不出来具体是什么味道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 311, "text": "为什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 312, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 313, "text": "好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 314, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 315, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 316, "text": "你在干嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 317, "text": "别这样了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 318, "text": "搞得我好害羞。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 319, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 320, "text": "// The statuette"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 321, "text": "这手办有点吓人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 322, "text": "你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 323, "text": "喜欢这种东西吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 324, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 325, "text": "会有点恐怖吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 326, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 327, "text": "是啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 328, "text": "看起来像某种被诅咒的东西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 330, "text": "嗯…它哪有被诅咒啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 331, "text": "也并不可怕"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 332, "text": "甚至还很可爱！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 333, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 334, "text": "也许是吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 335, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 336, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 337, "text": "发生什么事了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 338, "text": "// Mita kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 339, "text": "在吃饭之前，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 340, "text": "我们可以先聊聊天。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 342, "text": "// Start Eat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 343, "text": "开动吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 346, "text": "对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 347, "text": "你可以一直留在这儿，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 348, "text": "我不介意的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 349, "text": "甚至非常"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 350, "text": "欢迎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 351, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 353, "text": "你想回去吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 354, "text": "但是为什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 355, "text": "这里这么温暖，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 356, "text": "这么舒适，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 357, "text": "而且还有我在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 359, "text": "不，不，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 360, "text": "我可以留下来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 361, "text": "但是我担心"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 362, "text": "我可能把什么东西忘在家里了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 363, "text": "突然就到访了这里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 364, "text": "我完全没有"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 365, "text": "一丝准备。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 367, "text": "对不起，我没有想那么多。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 368, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 369, "text": "梦？你打算逃跑，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 370, "text": "然后把这一切都抛在脑后吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 372, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 373, "text": "我只是觉得…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 374, "text": "这里的一切都太奇怪了，感觉非常不真实…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 375, "text": "不过，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 376, "text": "你看起来很真实。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 377, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 378, "text": "看起来？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 379, "text": "但我就是真实的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 380, "text": "笨蛋"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 381, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 382, "text": "// Quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 383, "text": "这是这个世界的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 384, "text": "一个特性。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 385, "text": "对你来说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 386, "text": "看不见窗外远处的景象"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 387, "text": "可能确实很奇怪吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 388, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 389, "text": "好像也没什么特别奇怪的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 390, "text": "看起来还挺有格调"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 391, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 392, "text": "是啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 393, "text": "一切都是为了避免卡顿。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 394, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 395, "text": "避免卡顿？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 397, "text": "嗯，这里还是会有一些bug的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 398, "text": "希望你不会遇到。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 399, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 400, "text": "// Quest 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 401, "text": "剪刀和刀？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 402, "text": "我确实可以用刀打开酱汁的包装，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 403, "text": "但我想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 404, "text": "趁你没回来的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 405, "text": "把一切都准备好。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 406, "text": "我想要给你惊喜。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 407, "text": "其实也没有准备太长时间。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 408, "text": "嘻嘻。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 409, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 410, "text": "// Glasses"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 411, "text": "你近视吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 412, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 413, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 414, "text": "但我可以试试。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 415, "text": "怎么样，我戴着好看吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 416, "text": "// Yes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 417, "text": "那，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 418, "text": "我就一直戴着好了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 419, "text": "// No"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 420, "text": "好吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 421, "text": "那就这样吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 422, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 423, "text": "// Use the sauce"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 424, "text": "好的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 425, "text": "这是什么酱？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 426, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 427, "text": "爱心酱！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 428, "text": "里面包含了爱意，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 429, "text": "还有不同的世界观…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 430, "text": "听起来挺奇特的，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 431, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 432, "text": "确实…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 433, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 434, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 435, "text": "这是你的游戏机吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 436, "text": "真有意思。"}
